{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Game Languages:\u00a0</i></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/31e8058f46c8efd82cb41da2db875d97.webp?t=1773521489\" width=32 height=32 /></span><i><strong>\u00a0English,\u00a0\u00a0</strong></i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/870dcd22bd08e6ba678a9407734ecdc2.webp?t=1773521489\" width=32 height=32 /></span><strong><i>\u00a0Spanish.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Caverns &amp; Dryads&quot;\u00a0</strong>takes you to a world of fantasy, where you will guide Tamzyn, the dryad <strong>warrioress\u00a0</strong>\u2014<strong>deadly\u00a0</strong>and <strong>beautiful</strong>\u2014 and Sioul, the <strong>wizard\u00a0</strong>\u2014<strong>tenacious\u00a0</strong>and <strong>powerful</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, they will <strong>explore forgotten cities of mysterious beauty and dungeons filled with dangerous monsters.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an adventure full of<strong> action, magic, and romance!\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/a3a6c1e024d10d9619d3e25d8c865181.avif?t=1773521489\" width=794 height=582 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT GENRE OF GAME IS THIS?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caverns and Dryads <strong>includes features from RPGs, roguelikes, and visual novels.</strong> But it was created with total creative freedom, without following formulas or conventions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>solo developer,</strong> I summoned its fantasy world without adhering to any trends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a1That\u2019s why it\u2019s <strong>unlike anything you\u2019ve played before!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TELL ME ABOUT THE GAME WORLD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is an <strong>affirmation of heroic will and true love, against all </strong>dangers and limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Caverns and Dryads shows you a world with <strong>danger</strong> and <strong>wonder</strong>, <strong>romance</strong> and <strong>heroism</strong>, and <strong>mythic creatures.</strong> It has its own <strong>lore</strong> and aesthetics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this underground universe, <strong>dryads</strong> and the <strong>Magic Council</strong> play a central role. The shadow of the <strong>Chaotic Invasion</strong> marks their past, and menaces their future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to meet <strong>the Purple King</strong> of the Amethyst Throne, Aubeline <strong>the queen of the dryads</strong>, and many other <strong>unforgettable</strong> <strong>characters</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOME FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>freely explore and move through the different locations</strong> in the game world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live the main <strong>quests</strong> and accept <strong>jobs</strong> to get gold or just <strong>explore</strong> the world to get experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>actions will advance the story and the relationship between the warrioress and the wizard.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They are heroes: they don't fall easily.</strong> The wizard can resurrect the warrioress, but at a cost that you can recover if you play <strong>wisely</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based 2D action</strong> that's <strong>immersive</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong>, yet <strong>thrilling</strong> during <strong>battles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in short sessions or for hours, immersing yourself in this <strong>fantasy</strong> universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>100% free game.</strong> You can buy the DLCs to get extra content, features and lore, but it's <strong>not</strong> mandatory.\u00a0If you enjoy the game and want to support my work, you can buy a DLC \u2014it helps me keep expanding this world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/d9238c24c89abdab40a830c748afeca2.avif?t=1773521489\" width=800 height=472 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE COMMUNITY: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I constantly add new content, stories, and features! Caverns and Dryads is a <strong>living, ever\u2011expanding world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the community</strong> and share your thoughts! Visit the Steam <strong>discussions</strong>, read the <strong>blog</strong>, or drop me a message on <strong>Discord</strong>! (links here or from the game menu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/c11f6b8bae72f94558605955dafb3e69.avif?t=1773521489\" width=800 height=814 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gnomurk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634870/db660fb7f3af6bcb88d27f1ae29423c0234e4e02.jpg"},{"name":"Abyss Dragon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634870/fdcc7d00defee877a7488b9c1fae797193335868.jpg"},{"name":"Abyssocyclops","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3634870/c16d2a9a96804d62b638a19315f85845c624ca45.jpg"},{