t that you can recover if you play <strong>wisely</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based 2D action</strong> that's <strong>immersive</strong> and <strong>relaxing</strong>, yet <strong>thrilling</strong> during <strong>battles</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in short sessions or for hours, immersing yourself in this <strong>fantasy</strong> universe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>100% free game.</strong> You can buy the DLCs to get extra content, features and lore, but it's <strong>not</strong> mandatory.\u00a0If you enjoy the game and want to support my work, you can buy a DLC \u2014it helps me keep expanding this world.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/d9238c24c89abdab40a830c748afeca2.avif?t=1773521489\" width=800 height=472 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE COMMUNITY: </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I constantly add new content, stories, and features! Caverns and Dryads is a <strong>living, ever\u2011expanding world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join the community</strong> and share your thoughts! Visit the Steam <strong>discussions</strong>, read the <strong>blog</strong>, or drop me a message on <strong>Discord</strong>! (links here or from the game menu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634870/extras/c11f6b8bae72f94558605955dafb3e69.avif?t=1773521489\" width=800 height=814 /></span></p>","developers":["Louis Dubois"],"dlc":[4244830,3921840],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"3